    "method": "Real run economy and native AI/combat/spells/projectiles on authored terrain/navigation, advanced in 55 ms ticks. Every cohort process completed with exit 0 and the unchanged native-table assertion. Six seeds per starter; six policies/difficulty combinations share seeds 3000\u20133017.",
    "policy_limits": "Policies merge and auto-arrange competently. Recovery is chosen when injured; otherwise companion/pact upgrade. No policy selects economic boons. First-affordable is a purchase heuristic, not a model of a new human player. Ranged policy recruits a missing melee beast for Wild kin. No adaptive enemy-specific positioning.",
    "source_provenance": "The first five cohorts predate the final Vanguard promotion and two-choice exhausted-boon fallback. Their exact source hashes were reconstructed by reversing only those two edits. Their traces contain no Vanguard pact and their policy never buys boons, so neither changed path is exercised. The final melee cohort uses the current rules/run hashes. Terrain source later changes only rendered paving; native/physical/navigation digests match exactly. Original run hashes are preserved, not relabeled.",
    "calibration": {
      "description": "Same 18 melee seeds before Vanguard support was promoted from goblina1/goblina3/orcfemalea5 to goblina3/orcfemalea5/orcfemalea7",
      "runs": 18,
      "clears": 11,
      "fights": 308,
      "included_in_final_comparison": false
    },
