    "interpretation": "Ranged/magic remains more forgiving. Melee clears improved from 11/18 to 13/18 in the paired calibration. Starter-focus clears fall 15/18 to 14/18 to 10/18 across Standard/Veteran/Champion. Samples are too small to prove equal balance or significant differences; these are automated clear rates, not human win rates.",
    "unchanged_evolution_evidence": "264 prior paired native fights, recorded in arena-pve-2026-10-16.json; not rerun because recipes and native stats are unchanged."
  },
